1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,120
Section eight.

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,040
Augmentation.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,420
The purpose is to assemble a decision-ready request from

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:10,040
the evidence and retrieved possibilities.

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,640
Retrieval supplies options.

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:17,000
Augmentation explains those options and the rules for selecting

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,440
them.

8
00:00:26,327 --> 00:00:30,007
For Orion, the payload includes repository identity,

9
00:00:30,907 --> 00:00:32,367
public or synthetic source status,

10
00:00:33,087 --> 00:00:33,307
revision,

11
00:00:34,207 --> 00:00:34,587
evidence hash,

12
00:00:35,407 --> 00:00:38,467
selected evidence, phrase strings, and candidate records.

13
00:00:39,867 --> 00:00:42,687
Evidence one preserves the patient-intake sentence.

14
00:00:43,587 --> 00:00:47,707
Candidate records contain canonical ID, kind, name, and

15
00:00:47,707 --> 00:00:48,087
description.

16
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:52,447
Aliases helped retrieval but are not serialized into those

17
00:00:52,447 --> 00:00:53,287
candidate objects.

18
00:00:54,367 --> 00:00:56,827
Expected evaluation labels are never supplied.

19
00:01:01,693 --> 00:01:04,793
The system instructions require supported approved IDs,

20
00:01:05,773 --> 00:01:06,673
primary-purpose Topics,

21
00:01:07,293 --> 00:01:09,013
and primary implementation Tags.

22
00:01:10,001 --> 00:01:13,101
Shared frameworks do not prove initiative membership.

23
00:01:14,648 --> 00:01:15,468
Negation matters;

24
00:01:16,608 --> 00:01:17,688
multiple Projects are allowed.

25
00:01:18,855 --> 00:01:21,875
Unsupported input can produce no match or a request

26
00:01:21,875 --> 00:01:22,955
for more context.

27
00:01:24,543 --> 00:01:28,223
User decisions remain application constraints rather than an

28
00:01:28,223 --> 00:01:30,243
invitation for the model to overrule them.

29
00:01:35,127 --> 00:01:37,947
A strict response schema describes assignments,

30
00:01:38,767 --> 00:01:39,287
evidence references,

31
00:01:40,047 --> 00:01:40,347
reasons,

32
00:01:40,967 --> 00:01:42,126
status, and summary.

33
00:01:42,126 --> 00:01:45,646
LangChain binds that schema to the hosted request.

34
00:01:47,065 --> 00:01:50,465
The harness inspects the assembled messages and schema before

35
00:01:50,465 --> 00:01:51,645
counting input tokens.

36
00:01:52,864 --> 00:01:56,684
This is retrieval-augmented structured classification, with

37
00:01:56,684 --> 00:01:58,144
durable application memory.

38
00:01:59,003 --> 00:02:03,523
It is not a conversational document-question-answering agent, and

39
00:02:03,523 --> 00:02:06,403
adaptive budgets do not turn it into Adaptive RAG.
